# Code owners for go-taas.
#
# Rules live in GOVERNANCE.md (§3 permission matrix, §6 two-person rule) and the
# roster in MAINTAINERS.md. CODEOWNERS is the enforcement half of path
# ownership: a matching owner is requested for review, and with "Require review
# from Code Owners" enabled in branch protection, the pull request cannot merge
# without it.
#
# Bootstrap note: the organization teams do not exist yet (see MAINTAINERS.md
# §7). GitHub silently ignores a team handle that does not exist or lacks write
# access, so the interim owner @sanmuny is listed on every rule until the teams
# are created. Remove the individual handle from a rule once its team exists.
#
# The last matching pattern wins, so broad rules come first and high-risk paths
# come last.

# Default: every path needs a Maintainer review.
*                                   @go-taas/maintainers @sanmuny

# Core services, shared packages, and the controller.
/services/                          @go-taas/area-core @sanmuny
/pkg/                               @go-taas/area-core @sanmuny
/internal/                          @go-taas/area-core @sanmuny

# API contract.
/proto/                             @go-taas/area-api @sanmuny

# Web console.
/web/                               @go-taas/area-web @sanmuny

# Tests and end-to-end suites.
/test/                              @go-taas/area-test @sanmuny

# Documentation and the static site.
/site/                              @go-taas/area-docs @sanmuny
/site/docs/                         @go-taas/area-docs @sanmuny
/*.md                               @go-taas/area-docs @sanmuny

# High-risk paths: two-person rule (GOVERNANCE.md §6). A Steering member plus a
# Maintainer must both review, so a release, workflow, or governance change can
# never merge on a single approval.
/deploy/                            @go-taas/steering @go-taas/maintainers @sanmuny
/build/                             @go-taas/steering @go-taas/maintainers @sanmuny
/.github/workflows/                 @go-taas/steering @go-taas/maintainers @sanmuny
/.github/CODEOWNERS                 @go-taas/steering @go-taas/maintainers @sanmuny
/GOVERNANCE.md                      @go-taas/steering @go-taas/maintainers @sanmuny
/GOVERNANCE.zh-cn.md                @go-taas/steering @go-taas/maintainers @sanmuny
/MAINTAINERS.md                     @go-taas/steering @go-taas/maintainers @sanmuny
/MAINTAINERS.zh-cn.md               @go-taas/steering @go-taas/maintainers @sanmuny
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md                 @go-taas/steering @go-taas/maintainers @sanmuny
/LICENSE                            @go-taas/steering @go-taas/maintainers @sanmuny
